Package: faultycmd
Version: 3.0.0.5
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: Electronic Cats <support@electroniccats.com>
Depends: libc6
Homepage: https://github.com/ElectronicCats/faultycat
Description: Host tool for FaultyCat v3 — EMFI / crowbar / SWD / JTAG fault injection
 faultycmd is the click+Rich CLI and Textual TUI for driving the FaultyCat v3
 fault-injection board over its USB CDC composite interface (EMFI, crowbar,
 SWD/JTAG scanner, and campaign sweeps).
